            "text": "<p>As the number of individuals affected by the COVID-19 epidemic continue to climb, it is more important than ever to maintain safe social distancing practices in the workplace, in public spaces, and even at home. Although customers are advised to maintain a distance of at least 6 ft. between individuals while in public, it can be difficult for people to gauge distances or know where to stand. Vivid social distance floor decals and tape are an easy way to encourage compliance with public health recommendations for social distancing by offering clear visual guidance.</p>",
