        "heading_wPhVgD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "What’s the Purpose of Social Distancing Tape?",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "rich_text_cstm": "<p>Social distancing tape provides a clear and obvious boundary for social distancing, so that customers can safely stand far enough apart without unnecessary confusion. The bold colors and patterns of social distancing tape catch the customer’s eye, making them more aware of distancing guidelines. Specifically, social distancing tape is useful for marking 6 ft. distances between customers, so they can more easily determine the safest distance to prevent the spread of COVID-19.</p>"
