        "collapsible_item_w8RiKT": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Benefits to Using Social Distancing Tape",
            "content": "<p>Social distancing tape offers a convenient, easy-to-apply option to help customers maintain adequate social distance during the COVID-19 pandemic. Not only is it useful for retail settings, it can also be used in gas stations, office environments, and myriad other business environments where multiple people may risk close interactions.</p>",
