        "collapsible_item_tVVp8w": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Cost Effective",
            "content": "<p>An inexpensive tool, social distancing tape is a low cost investment that significantly increases your customer and employee safety in public or private environments with a high risk of COVID-19 spread.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_c4a4p8": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Versatility",
            "content": "<p>NADCO is pleased to offer social distancing tapes in a broad range of colors, designs, materials, and sizes to meet the particular needs of your application. Our extensive range of adhesive materials allows us to create tapes and labels that can adhere to almost any surface, from fabric to tile, plastic, and wood.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_mkkjEX": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Durability",
            "content": "<p>NADCO’s social distancing tape is built to last. We use only the highest quality materials to ensure you rarely have to replace your social distancing tape, even in high traffic areas. Our tape’s durability allows it to withstand outdoor environments, corrosive cleaning chemicals, abrasive materials, and even high foot and vehicle traffic.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_LwbihQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "And Many More!",
            "content": "<p>An inexpensive, versatile, and durable solution, NADCO’s social distancing tape offers a variety of additional benefits for your home or business:</p><ul><li>Easy handling and seamless application</li><li>Quick bonding adhesive with clean removal</li><li>Effective for both indoor and outdoor applications</li><li>Superior resistance to abrasion, corrosion, and humidity</li></ul>",
