        "text_3DhUyN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "content_alignment": "left",
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Social Distancing Floor Decal Applications",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "description": "<p>Supermarkets, gas stations, parks, convenience stores, banks, schools and even outdoor parking areas all offer enhanced risk of COVID-19 transmission. Social distancing tape can be used to mark floors, walls, equipment, and any other visible surface to help customers and workers maintain a safe 6 ft. distance. It is useful for providing highly visible markings for customers to follow, and can provide a bold point of reference for signs and labels with additional instructions and reminders.</p><p>As the COVID-19 crisis deepened, even businesses without customer traffic have become increasingly aware of social distancing requirements. Warehouses, distribution centers, manufacturing facilities, and laboratories are exercising these specifications, using tape, signs, and labels as reminders for employees who are used to working in much closer conditions. High performance tapes from NADCO provide a visible and reliable means of keeping busy employees at a safe distance.</p><h3><strong>Safe and Reliable Social Distancing Tape From NADCO</strong></h3><p>At NADCO, we are committed to helping our customers in every industry weather the COVID-19 crisis. Our durable and highly visible social distancing tape can be tailored to meet nearly any color, shape, size, and design you need to ensure the safety of your workers and customers. To learn more about our social distancing tape and other adhesive products, <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\">contact our experts today</a>.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-inherit",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary",
            "button_icon": "none",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center",
            "block_custom_class": ""
          }
        }
      },
